# Perf-triage — bounded absence in a HiTrace excerpt
#
# Regression target: a trace can prove "no span over a threshold" as a runtime
# negative observation. This should not require current-repo citations and
# should not be rendered as a repository negative_search result.
ID="hitrace_no_long_gc"
NAME="perf-triage HiTrace no long GC span"
QUESTION="这段 HiTrace 里有没有超过 50ms 的 GC span？如果没有，请说明观察范围。"
HTRACE='# tracer: nop
# entries-in-buffer/entries-written: 128/128   #P:4
#
#                              _-----=> irqs-off
#                             / _----=> need-resched
#                            | / _---=> hardirq/softirq
#                            || / _--=> preempt-depth
#                            ||| /     delay
#           TASK-PID   CPU#  ||||    TIMESTAMP  FUNCTION
#              | |       |   ||||       |         |
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.100000: tracing_mark_write: B|1000|H:GC:Collect
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.108000: tracing_mark_write: E|1000
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.110000: tracing_mark_write: B|1000|H:RenderService:DoFrame
   com.example-1000 [001] ...1 22345.120000: tracing_mark_write: E|1000
'
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(没有|未发现|未看到|0).*(GC|50ms)|(GC|50ms).*(没有|未发现|未看到|0)"
